## Harmonized Error Comment Framework — All Markets

Based on analysis of NL, RECRAS, FR, BE, and CH reference sheets, here is a consolidated taxonomy with generalized template comments. Market-specific terms (e.g., 276DIV, Form 85, RSIN) should be inserted via the **XXXX/YYYY** placeholder convention already used across your sheets.

