### Key Design Principles Applied

| Principle | Detail |
|-----------|--------|
| **XXXX / YYYY placeholders** | Preserved throughout — consistent with existing convention across all markets |
| **Document types** | Generalized; market-specific forms (276DIV, Form 85, Form 5000/5001, IB95/96, F6166) are inserted as values of XXXX |
| **Category structure** | Three top-level categories: *Missing*, *Discrepancies*, *Technical/Other* — maps cleanly to NL, FR, BE, CH structures |
| **Market-specific rules absorbed** | FR's LTT threshold, duplication, and reclaim service disclaimer; CH's SIX SIS ineligibility; BE's SICAV eligibility; NL's RSIN — all retained as sub-categories rather than market siloes |
| **Comment style** | Sentence-case, factual, no market-specific jargon hardcoded into the comment itself |

